Upstream: Vigil
---------------

AutoSecOps is based on Vigil (Apache-2.0), an open source AI SOC by the
Vigil-SOC project: https://github.com/Vigil-SOC/vigil
Copyright 2026 The Vigil-SOC authors.

AutoSecOps is a modified version of Vigil. It was forked from upstream main at
8813f24a (Vigil 0.7.0) on 2026-10-11 and synced for the last time at 58736836
(git tag fork-point-2026-10). SingularityRD has modified files of the original
work and added new ones since then: product name and branding, database init
files, Federation, Medic, setup screens, the approval and audit model, release
and air-gap tooling, and more. The git history records every change
(git log fork-point-2026-10..HEAD), and FORK.md lists where this product
deliberately differs from upstream.

